<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:20px; color:#c0392b;">Payment Verification Issue</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:14px; color:#4a5568; line-height:1.6;">
  Hi <%= order.customerName %>, we were unable to verify your payment for order #<%= orderNumber %>.
</p>

<% if (order.paymentRejectionReason) { %>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:20px; background-color:#fdf2f2; border-radius:8px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:14px 16px; font-size:14px; color:#c0392b;">
      <strong>Reason:</strong> <%= order.paymentRejectionReason %>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<% } %>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px; font-size:14px; color:#4a5568;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Order Number:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0; text-align:right;">#<%= orderNumber %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Payment Status:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0; text-align:right; color:#c0392b; font-weight:600;">Not Verified</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:4px 0;"><strong>Order Status:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:4px 0; text-align:right;">Pending</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px; font-size:14px; color:#4a5568; line-height:1.6;">
  Please upload a new payment receipt with the correct transaction details so we can review it again. Your order will remain on hold until this is resolved.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-radius:8px; background-color:#00b4ff;">
      <a href="<%= orderUrl %>" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#051221; text-decoration:none;">Resubmit Payment Details</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
